  "dialogue": [
    {
      "no": 1,
      "speaker": "沈墨",
      "text": "绛珠——私动凡心，泪债难偿。",
      "emotion": "不疾不徐",
      "targetSeconds": 3.75,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 2,
      "speaker": "沈墨",
      "text": "依律，天刑三雷。",
      "emotion": "宣判",
      "targetSeconds": 3.75,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 3,
      "speaker": "绛珠",
      "text": "我犯了哪一条？",
      "emotion": "发颤、咬唇",
      "targetSeconds": 3.04,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 4,
      "speaker": "沈墨",
      "text": "动心。",
      "emotion": "冷淡",
      "targetSeconds": 3.04,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 5,
      "speaker": "神瑛",
      "text": "别怕。",
      "emotion": "低声、回头",
      "targetSeconds": 3.75,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 6,
      "speaker": "绛珠",
      "text": "神瑛，你走！／我不要你管——",
      "emotion": "急喊",
      "targetSeconds": 3.04,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 7,
      "speaker": "神瑛",
      "text": "你别哭。",
      "emotion": "不回头",
      "targetSeconds": 3.04,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 8,
      "speaker": "沈墨",
      "text": "神瑛侍者，你要替她担？",
      "emotion": "抬眸",
      "targetSeconds": 3.75,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 9,
      "speaker": "神瑛",
      "text": "要打打我。她犯的哪一条，我来担。",
      "emotion": "决然",
      "targetSeconds": 4.46,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 10,
      "speaker": "沈墨",
      "text": "你担得起么？",
      "emotion": "一字一顿",
      "targetSeconds": 3.04,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 11,
      "speaker": "沈墨",
      "text": "她是草木之身，你是石之魂。你护她一日，就是陪她还一日的债。",
      "emotion": "冷、慢",
      "targetSeconds": 7.29,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 12,
      "speaker": "神瑛",
      "text": "那便一起还。",
      "emotion": "冷笑",
      "targetSeconds": 3.04,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 13,
      "speaker": "绛珠",
      "text": "不要——",
      "emotion": "撕心裂肺",
      "targetSeconds": 3.75,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 14,
      "speaker": "沈墨",
      "text": "你看，它记上了。（画外）",
      "emotion": "冷",
      "targetSeconds": 4.46,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 15,
      "speaker": "神瑛",
      "text": "这一瓶是卯时采的露，比昨日甜些。／叶子又卷起来了。怎么，今日不高兴？",
      "emotion": "笑、温",
      "targetSeconds": 8.0,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 16,
      "speaker": "绛珠",
      "text": "那时我还不会说话，只能摇一摇叶子。（画外）",
      "emotion": "少女声、轻",
      "targetSeconds": 4.46,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 17,
      "speaker": "神瑛",
      "text": "再过三百年，你就能化形了。／到时候，我教你说话，教你走路，教你看星星。",
      "emotion": "温柔、向往",
      "targetSeconds": 8.0,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 18,
      "speaker": "绛珠",
      "text": "我不知道，他随口说的每一句话，都在替我攒一条命。（画外）",
      "emotion": "轻、怅",
      "targetSeconds": 5.88,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 19,
      "speaker": "绛珠",
      "text": "你……是谁？",
      "emotion": "轻声、怔",
      "targetSeconds": 5.17,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 20,
      "speaker": "神瑛",
      "text": "神瑛。赤瑕宫的。／以后，我日日来。",
      "emotion": "喉结动、认真",
      "targetSeconds": 3.75,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "no": 21,
      "speaker": "沈墨",
      "text": "你护得了一时，护不了一世。（画外）",
      "emotion": "阴冷",
      "targetSeconds": 3.75,
      "subtitle": "none",
      "voiceRef": "none",
      "sfx": []
    }
  ],
